Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The complete, machine-generated attribution list for everything actually linked
into a build is THIRD-PARTY.md, produced by `cargo about generate` (see
about.toml). Regenerate it as part of preparing a release; it is not committed,
because a stale attribution file is worse than none.

The components below are the load-bearing third-party pieces of the planned
engine. They are listed here so the attribution obligation is visible from the
first commit rather than discovered at release time. An entry appears here only
once it is genuinely part of a build:

