                                             LibRaw LLC (info@libraw.org).
                                             https://www.libraw.org

      Linked via the `libraw-rs-sys` crate, which vendors LibRaw's sources.
      LibRaw is triple-licensed (LGPL-2.1, CDDL-1.0, commercial) and rawkit
      elects **CDDL-1.0**, which permits static linking and source inclusion
      without disclosing the application's own source. Attribution is required
