      which is why that crate is a hard boundary. LibRaw's optional GPL demosaic
      packs are not compiled into this build.

      The CDDL-1.0 text accompanies the LibRaw sources in the vendored crate
      and is available at https://opensource.org/licenses/CDDL-1.0

